    58	No change recommended. The pilot’s 0/30 gives the correctly reported \(U_{95}=0.0950\) [in `trigger_rates.csv`](/Users/jackneo/Documents/vonhippel-base9/astro-wd/generalization/results/2026-08-30_d2_pilot/metrics/trigger_rates.csv:2), so it is essentially uninformative about a 0.5% threshold.
    59	
    60	At \(n=1000\), the frozen observed-x rule behaves as follows:
    61	
