generalization/reviews/G4/PROMPT_methods.md:1:G4 — pilot metrics sanity (METHODS / referee lens). Read generalization/results/2026-08-30_d2_pilot/README.md, its metrics/ and run/ directories, the D2 sections of generalization/GENERALIZATION_PLAN.md and generalization/METRICS_SPEC.md, and the shard builder scripts/generalization/build_d2_shards.py (match_templates: 10/50/90th-percentile picks over exposures-per-night). The pilot is non-confirmatory. Questions: (1) Given the pool's degenerate exposures-per-night distribution (quantiles 1.0/1.0/2.0; K0 == K1 for all 103 targets), what would a referee say about the "K=3 at 10/50/90th percentile" design, and what is the smallest prespecified change (Amendment 4) that keeps the design honest — relabel the strata as matched replicate windows, re-stratify on a covariate that actually varies (name it and the exact deterministic rule), or keep as is with an explicit statement? Consider that regenerating gen1 costs ~90 s and the pilot ~2 h, and that NO confirmatory run exists yet. (2) Native variability: 37% of pool windows are published variables and detection-only P4 conflates native triggers with injected-signal recovery (pilot: on confirmed windows 11/13 confirmed vs 2/13 recovered; on not_detected windows 4/15 confirmed, 4/4 recovered). The plan pre-registered "native variability handled by frequency-matched scoring plus paired controls". Is the current reporting (P4 detection-only as primary; frequency recovery separate; controls' native trigger rate; paired census/L-S discordance) sufficient for a referee, or must the primary D2 claim be reframed (e.g. injected-signal recovery = confirmed AND dominant-mode direct; or detection conditioned on the paired control being not_detected)? Give the exact estimand definition and which spec paragraph changes. (3) The controls reproduced their published statuses 10/10 — state what that does and does not certify. (4) Anything in the run/metrics provenance record a referee could still attack. Output: numbered answers with evidence, an explicit recommended Amendment 4 text (or "no amendment"), then "## Verdict: PROCEED-AS-IS | PROCEED-WITH-AMENDMENT-4 | HOLD". Do not edit files.
