generalization/reviews/G4/PROMPT_stats_r2.md:1:G4 ROUND 2 (statistics). Your round-1 verdict: generalization/reviews/G4/sol_stats.md (PROCEED-WITH-AMENDMENT-4 with a recommended amendment text and three metric-layer fixes: surface pseudoreplication, degenerate paired-bootstrap intervals, chance-match mismatch; plus descriptive labelling of sensitivity Wilson rows). Amendment 4 is implemented in commit b854e97 (pytest tests/ -q = 46 passing in .venv-gen; D1 regression 11/13, 9/13, 13/13). Verify each item against the CURRENT files with file:line evidence and runtime probes where the sandbox allows: (1) stratification: scripts/generalization/build_d2_shards.py load_pool computes W_g = Σ_nights max(n_zg,night − 1, 0) and match_templates sorts by (wg_contrasts, source_id) with unchanged round-half-even 10/50/90 picks; d2_truth_model.check_wg_strata (strict K0<K1<K2, production refuses), manifest column template_wg_contrasts, WG_SURFACE_EDGES = (15, 41, 84, 217) = the pool's 20/40/60/80th percentiles (the builder recomputes and refuses production on mismatch; pool quantiles recorded in the generation manifest) — NOTE: the methods reviewer proposed W_g (= your n_eff minus the number of multi-exposure nights); assess whether W_g is an acceptable realization of your recommendation; (2) primary P4 = recovery endpoint (confirmed AND best_candidate_matches_dominant == direct) in metrics_generalization.d2_cluster_bootstrap, detection-only = "trigger" secondary; flags prespecified_primary / confirmatory_decision (P5 sole decision) — trigger_rates for P5; (3) paired controls: d2_paired_controls scores each control's candidate against the partner target's dominant injected mode (2×2 counts, B-only/C-only/union, target-standardized paired differences and P(R_B=1,R_C=0) with common draws, quiet-control-conditioned secondary, reuse table d2_control_reuse.csv from the full manifest); (4) surfaces: d2_surfaces / _target_equal_cells (n_windows, n_targets, target-equal point, target-cluster bootstrap when >= 5 targets, counts only otherwise; axes W_g × amplitude, period × amplitude, amplitude); (5) chance-match: d2_chance_match — 10,000 frozen-seed target-level derangements, all K together, vectorized direct matching to the permuted target's dominant mode and to any mode, target-equal rates; (6) degenerate paired contrasts → interval "cp_discordance_bound" with ±U95 on the discordance probability (contrast rows also carry discordance_u95); (7) sensitivity.csv rows labelled descriptive with clamped bounds; D2 row-level intervals in completeness/contingency suppressed; (8) the spec text: generalization/METRICS_SPEC.md v4 header, estimand vocabulary, P4 definition, units/strata paragraph, complementarity, surfaces, guards, outputs; generalization/GENERALIZATION_PLAN.md Amendment 4 paragraph; ledger entry at the end of generalization/reviews/G2_FREEZE.md (SHAs must match current bytes). Tests: tests/test_d2_shards_contract.py (W_g strata, target-level surfaces, chance-match, paired controls, degenerate contrast, stars-file guard). Report per item RESOLVED/PARTIALLY/UNRESOLVED with evidence, any NEW finding tagged BLOCKING/MAJOR/MINOR with the exact fix, then "## Verdict: APPROVE | APPROVE-WITH-CHANGES | REJECT". Do not edit files.
generalization/reviews/G4/sol_methods.md:13:   Exact selection rule: retain the current magnitude-matched candidate pool and fallback; sort it lexicographically by `(W_g, source_id)`; select indices `int(np.round(q*(N-1)))` for \(q=\{0.10,0.50,0.90\}\), preserving NumPy round-half-even. Record `template_wg_contrasts` and require \(W_{g,0}<W_{g,1}<W_{g,2}\) in production.
generalization/reviews/G4/sol_methods.md:63:   - P4 definition [lines 124–144](</Users/jackneo/Documents/vonhippel-base9/astro-wd/generalization/METRICS_SPEC.md:124>): replace \(y=I(\text{confirmed})\) with \(Y^{rec}\) above and prohibit further hierarchy changes after Amendment 4.
generalization/reviews/G4/sol_methods.md:64:   - Complementarity [lines 177–184](</Users/jackneo/Documents/vonhippel-base9/astro-wd/generalization/METRICS_SPEC.md:177>): label D2 census/L-S tables as descriptive post-injection response, without recovery attribution.
generalization/reviews/G4/sol_methods.md:70:   It does not certify candidate frequency/pass identity, census reproduction, all 119 generated controls, the full 928-window pool, representativeness of the ten pilot controls, injected-signal fidelity, frequency recovery, or false-alarm calibration. Only 10 of the 30 nominal-B pilot pairs had their controls run, so it also cannot support a pilot-wide paired adjustment. The observed 8/10 is descriptive, not an estimate of the pool’s native-trigger prevalence.
generalization/reviews/G4/sol_methods.md:83:   - The implementation marks production P4 detection rows `confirmatory=true`, while the plan/spec call P5 the sole confirmatory decision. Replace that ambiguous field with separate `prespecified_primary` and `confirmatory_decision` flags.
generalization/reviews/G4/sol_methods.md:86:### Recommended Amendment 4 text
generalization/reviews/G4/sol_methods.md:88:> **Amendment 4 — post-pilot D2 window stratification and recovery estimand (2026-08-30).** The gen1 timing pilot was explicitly non-confirmatory and exposed two design defects before any confirmatory-era run: median exposures per zg night does not separate the planned K strata, and detection-only P4 conflates native template triggers with injected-signal recovery. Gen1 results remain archived as exploratory evidence and enter no estimate.
generalization/reviews/G4/sol_methods.md:94:> Paired controls remain contextual. Report their native-trigger rate, P4 recovery stratified by paired-control status, and quiet-control-conditioned detection using pairs whose control is usable and `not_detected`; report target, pair, and unique-window denominators. D2 census/L-S complementarity remains descriptive.
generalization/reviews/G4/sol_methods.md:96:> Freeze the amended plan, specification, builder, and scorer before gen2. Regenerate gen2, rerun the stratified pilot, archive raw results and sidecars, bind the pilot-index SHA, and permit the full run only after all amended guards pass. Amendment 4 is disclosed as pilot-informed and is not represented as part of the original v3 preregistration.
generalization/reviews/G4/sol_methods.md:98:## Verdict: PROCEED-WITH-AMENDMENT-4
