er bootstrap when >= 5 targets, counts only otherwise; axes W_g × amplitude, period × amplitude, amplitude); (5) chance-match: d2_chance_match — 10,000 frozen-seed target-level derangements, all K together, vectorized direct matching to the permuted target's dominant mode and to any mode, target-equal rates; (6) degenerate paired contrasts → interval "cp_discordance_bound" with ±U95 on the discordance probability (contrast rows also carry discordance_u95); (7) sensitivity.csv rows labelled descriptive with clamped bounds; D2 row-level intervals in completeness/contingency suppressed; (8) the spec text: generalization/METRICS_SPEC.md v4 header, estimand vocabulary, P4 definition, units/strata paragraph, complementarity, surfaces, guards, outputs; generalization/GENERALIZATION_PLAN.md Amendment 4 paragraph; ledger entry at the end of generalization/reviews/G2_FREEZE.md (SHAs must match current bytes). Tests: tests/test_d2_shards_contract.py (W_g strata, target-level surfaces, chance-match, paired controls, degenerate contrast, stars-file guard). Report per item RESOLVED/PARTIALLY/UNRESOLVED with evidence, any NEW finding tagged BLOCKING/MAJOR/MINOR with the exact fix, then "## Verdict: APPROVE | APPROVE-WITH-CHANGES | REJECT". Do not edit files.
